		(property "Note" "I2C I/O expander at 0x20 (A0-A2 low): rotary encoder + spare on P0-P3, USB-C VBUS sense on P4, INT (open drain, GPIO3 internal pull-up) to GPIO3. TCA9554 = TCA9534 plus ~100k internal pull-ups on every P port (review 2026-10-15: the TCA9534 has none), so the encoder lines and unused P5-P7 never float; stronger pull-ups can go on the encoder cable from J7 pin 6"
